@startuml
title Phase 2 — 插件式 CLI 模块依赖
skinparam linetype ortho

package "kernel: cli" {
  [Repl]
  [Parser]
}
package "kernel: commands" {
  [CommandRegistry]
  [Phase1 Commands]
}
package "kernel: executor" {
  [CommandsExecutor]
}
package "kernel: model + extension points" {
  [EditorModel]
  [DisplayView]
  [Document]
  [ShapeFactory]
  [AttributeRegistry]
  [ShapeProvider]
  [AttributeHandler]
  [TreeDecorator]
  [Command]
}
package "assembly" {
  [Application / PluginRegistrar]
  [ConfiguredApplication]
  [PluginCatalog]
}
package "plugins" {
  [BuiltinShapePlugin]
  [BoxPlugin]
  [StatsPlugin]
  [DirPlugin]
  [ModifiedStarPlugin]
  [NodeDirectoryAdapter]
}
package "host" {
  [Node fs]
}

[Repl] --> [Parser]
[Repl] --> [CommandRegistry]
[CommandRegistry] --> [Phase1 Commands]
[Phase1 Commands] --> [CommandsExecutor]
[CommandsExecutor] --> [EditorModel]
[EditorModel] --> [Document]
[EditorModel] --> [ShapeFactory]
[EditorModel] --> [AttributeRegistry]
[EditorModel] --> [DisplayView]
[ShapeFactory] --> [ShapeProvider]
[AttributeRegistry] --> [AttributeHandler]
[DisplayView] --> [TreeDecorator]
[Phase1 Commands] --> [Command]

[Application / PluginRegistrar] --> [ShapeProvider]
[Application / PluginRegistrar] --> [AttributeHandler]
[Application / PluginRegistrar] --> [TreeDecorator]
[Application / PluginRegistrar] --> [Command]
[ConfiguredApplication] --> [PluginCatalog]
[ConfiguredApplication] --> [Application / PluginRegistrar]
[Application / PluginRegistrar] ..> [BuiltinShapePlugin] : 方式 A 显式实例化
[Application / PluginRegistrar] ..> [BoxPlugin]
[Application / PluginRegistrar] ..> [StatsPlugin]
[Application / PluginRegistrar] ..> [DirPlugin]
[Application / PluginRegistrar] ..> [ModifiedStarPlugin]
[PluginCatalog] ..> [BoxPlugin] : 方式 B 动态解析（无具名导入）

[BuiltinShapePlugin] ..> [ShapeProvider]
[BoxPlugin] ..> [ShapeProvider]
[BoxPlugin] ..> [AttributeHandler]
[BoxPlugin] ..> [TreeDecorator]
[StatsPlugin] ..> [Command]
[DirPlugin] ..> [Command]
[ModifiedStarPlugin] ..> [TreeDecorator]
[DirPlugin] --> [NodeDirectoryAdapter]
[NodeDirectoryAdapter] --> [Node fs]

note bottom of [PluginCatalog]
配置 loader 只按字符串解析模块；
不含具体插件 import、名称映射或 switch。
end note
@enduml
